# Packages the verify sandbox carries so a freshly built project can be imported
# offline. Curated, not open-ended: the sandbox has no network, so anything a
# build reaches for that is not here is reported as "not available in the verify
# image" rather than as a defect in the code.
fastapi
uvicorn
pydantic
pydantic-settings
httpx
jinja2
python-multipart
python-dotenv
requests
pypdf
sqlalchemy
openai
pytest

# The OCI client stack. Present because its absence was load-bearing: a build
# invented `load_client_config` from oci_genai_auth, and because the package was
# not in this image the sandbox could only call it "declared but not installed"
# — a warning — so a module that raises ImportError on its first line reached an
# approvable card. With the real package here, a fabricated symbol is an error.
# It is the largest dependency in this set by far; that is the price of checking
# the imports these projects actually make.
oci-genai-auth
